{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game about a very famous blogger, and you need to protect him at all costs! Set up guards on the street to repel waves of marginal people, bums, and other freaks who want to &quot;cancel&quot; our hero. Set up barricades to delay the crowd for a while, while your archers deal with the most zealous chaos fans. At the right moment, detonate bombs in the middle of the enemy ranks, creating noise, light, and a bit of panic! Survive 10 waves and your blogger will be safe, sound, and most importantly, online! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Beautiful graphics -Interesting gameplay -Lots of enemies</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4143230?t=1762288499","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4143230?t=1762288499","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143230/4ab72e6027e9a0cf044ce0a70227e424498cc731/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762288499","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143230/4ab72e6027e9a0cf044ce0a70227e424498cc731/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762288499","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game about a very famous blogger, and you need to protect him at all costs! Set up guards on the street to repel waves of marginal people, bums, and other freaks who want to &quot;cancel&quot; our hero. Set up barricades to delay the crowd for a while, while your archers deal with the most zealous chaos fans. At the right moment, detonate bombs in the middle of the enemy ranks, creating noise, light, and a bit of panic! Survive 10 waves and your blogger will be safe, sound, and most importantly, online! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Beauti